      `it is in compliance with the security procedures of the electronic filing service` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 28 r 12(10) the document is a secure electronic record` MEANS
    IF `the document is served, delivered or otherwise conveyed to a person using an identification code` AND `it is in compliance with the security procedures of the electronic filing service`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): "any document which is served, delivered or otherwise conveyed to a person using an identification code in compliance with the security procedures of the electronic filing service is a secure electronic record within the meaning of the Electronic Transactions Act"

