    IF `another provision of these Rules requires the Registrar to notify or to deliver or provide a document` AND `the person is a registered user`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where the Registrar is required by any other provision of these Rules to notify or to deliver or provide any document to a person who is a registered user, the Registrar may do so using the electronic filing service"
-- src:4375 | 14. Amendments to documents must be effected in the manner prescribed in any practice directions for the time being issued by the Registrar.
