-- src:4391 | 17. —(1) A user who has been registered as a registered user or an authorised user by the Registrar of the Supreme Court under Rule 6 is treated for the purposes of this Order as if he or she had also been similarly registered by the Registrar of the State Courts and the Registrar of the Family Justice Courts. (2) A user who has been registered as a registered user or an authorised user by the Registrar of the State Courts under Rule 6 is treated for the purposes of this Order as if he or she had also been similarly registered by the Registrar of the Supreme Court and the Registrar of the Family Justice Courts.
@ref O 28 r 17(1) (src:4391)
